OL,3,GNEWSARacism, misogyny and homophobia   
OL,4,Aremain in Met force, report finds      
OL,6,FLondon's mayor said much of the report 
OL,7,Fcame as "no surprise", and accused the 
OL,8,FMet and Sir Mark of "institutional     
OL,9,Fdefensiveness" that had downplayed the 
OL,10,Fseriousness of previous reports.       
